@startuml
hide footbox
participant "Metric Exporters" as E
participant "On-site\nPrometheus" as P
participant "Trace Producers" as T
participant "On-site\nAlloy" as A
participant "On-site Proxy" as OP
participant "Central Proxy" as CP
database "Central DB\nand Redis" as DB
participant "Bittensor\nPylon" as PY
participant "Central\nPrometheus" as CProm
participant "Tempo" as Tempo

== Validator registry ==
CP -> PY: Fetch validators for each BITTENSOR_NETUIDS entry
PY --> CP: Validator hotkeys grouped by netuid
CP -> DB: Store and cache active (hotkey, netuid) pairs

== Prometheus metrics ==
P -> E: Scrape metrics
P -> OP: POST /prometheus/outbound\nremote write with hotkey labels
OP -> OP: Sign payload and add\nhotkey, netuid, signature headers
OP -> CP: POST /prometheus/inbound
CP -> DB: Check active (hotkey, netuid)
CP -> CP: Verify signature and hotkey labels
CP -> CProm: POST /api/v1/write

== OpenTelemetry traces ==
T -> A: Export OTLP\n(gRPC :4317 or HTTP :4318)
A -> A: Tail sample and batch
A -> OP: POST /traces/outbound\nOTLP protobuf
OP -> OP: Upsert hotkey/netuid resource attributes,\nserialize, and sign the modified payload
OP -> CP: POST /traces/inbound
CP -> DB: Check active (hotkey, netuid)
CP -> CP: Verify signature and resource hotkeys
CP -> Tempo: POST /v1/traces
@enduml
